			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 706570101,
					"content": "你好，我是西风骑士团的莉兹。相信你也听说了吧，风花节期间，蒙德会有各种各样的好玩活动！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570102,
						706570103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉兹"
				},
				{
					"id": 706570102,
					"content": "有所耳闻…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706570104,
					"content": "我的工作，就是接待来到蒙德的客人，让每个人都能充分享受这个节日的乐趣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉兹"
				},
				{
					"id": 706570105,
					"content": "因为举办活动的地方不一定在城内，如果没人来介绍，有很多精彩游戏就会被错过了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉兹"
				},
				{
					"id": 706570106,
					"content": "现在要隆重向你推荐的就是这个——「百发百中」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉兹"
				},
				{
					"id": 706570107,
					"content": "顾名思义，就是射击天上的目标，如果又快又准，就可以获得高分！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570108,
						706570109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉兹"
				},
				{
					"id": 706570108,
					"content": "感觉很有意思。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706570110,
					"content": "没关系啦，我把位置帮你标记出来，你亲自去试一试就知道啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉兹"
				},
				{
					"id": 706570111,
					"content": "根据你获得的分数，还可以获得价值不等的奖品，无论是体验一下，还是追求极致，都很有乐趣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570112,
						706570113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉兹"
				},
				{
					"id": 706570112,
					"content": "有点兴趣了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706570114,
					"content": "嗯嗯，先去试试看吧！如果还想了解其他有趣的活动，也可以来找我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉兹"
				},
				{
					"id": 706570115,
					"content": "祝你玩得愉快！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莉兹"
				},
				{
					"id": 706570113,
					"content": "谢谢你的介绍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706570109,
					"content": "感觉有点难。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706570103,
					"content": "第一次听说。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706570104
